<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Oryx Q1 capex 85.97 mln rand.</title>
<headline>Oryx Q1 capex 85.97 mln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 85.97 vs 80.68</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		130,000 vs 116,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			   418 vs 419</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     3.2 vs 3.6</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     50,065 vs 55,735</p>
<p>Full name: Oryx Mine, a division of St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, managed by Gencor Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The mine said estimated capital expenditure over the next six months would be 148.5 million rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
